            <lb edRef="inst:4699" n="1a4"/> <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:4700"><rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:3764">sum rgya pa</rs>'i ti ka</rs></seg>
         </ab>
         <ab xml:space="preserve" type="incipit">
            <seg type="shared" xml:id="ex034022026-11-1310-15-48" status="reviewed">
            <milestone unit="section" n="Incipit (1b1)"/>
            <lb edRef="inst:4699" n="1b1"/> <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:4700"><rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:3764">sum brgya pa</rs>'i ti ka</rs> | 
            <rs type="deity">thams cad mkhyen pa</rs> la phyag 'tshal lo || 
            <lg><l>gang gis <rs type="deity">thub pa</rs>'i bstan pa 'di ||</l>
            <l>'jig rten snang mdzad rin po che ||</l>
            <l>rgya mtsho sgrol ba'i gru lta bu ||</l>
            <l>phyag 'tshal 'dul ba 'dzin rnams la'o ||</l></lg> 
            <lg><l><lb edRef="inst:4699" n="1b1"/> gnyen po bzhi dang ldan lasogs ||</l> 
               <l>mi nyams srung bas ° <lb edRef="inst:4699" n="1b2"/> ston pa ||</l>
               <l>rten bsam mi mthun phyogs rtsogs pa ||</l> 
               <l>srung pa'i thabs rnams 'dir gsal bya ||</l></lg>
         </seg>
         </ab>
         <ab xml:space="preserve" type="text_body">
            <seg type="shared" xml:id="ex034022026-11-1310-15-49" status="reviewed">
            <milestone unit="section" n="Body of the text (1b1-23b7)"/>
            de la spyir bstan chos kyi gleng gzhi 'brel na rnam par gzhag
            pa la 3 ste | ston pa dang bstan chos gus pa bskyed par bya ba'i phyir gleng gzhi dang | mtshan gyi don dang | gzhung bstan chos dngos kyi don no || </seg><gap reason="omitted"/>
          
            
          
            
          
            <lb n="N008"/><pb n="5"/><lb edRef="inst:4699" n="3a9"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex034022026-11-1310-33-52" status="reviewed">
            tshig don la rgya skad bod skad du bdebs <pb n="6"/><lb edRef="inst:4699" n="3b1"/> rgya gar skad du
            a rgya na bod skad du 'phags pa'o |
            sa r+ba na <expan>thams cad</expan> ¦
            a ti na yod par smra ba ¦
            sra ma ne ra na dge tshul gyi'o |
            ka ri ka na shig le'ur byas pa'o | 
            bod kyi mtshan la | 'phags pa ni 'phags pa'i chos dang ldan pa'i phyir ram ¦ rjes su slob pa'i don gyis na 'phags pa'o ||
            gzhi <expan>thams cad</expan> yod par smra ba ni shes bya'i gzhi la gtso bo sems kyi gzhi <lb edRef="inst:4699" n="3b2"/> 'khor sems las 'byung pa'i gzhi ¦ mi ldan pa 'du byed kyi gzhi ¦ chos nyid 'dus ma byas kyi gzhi ¦ snang pa gzugs kyi gzhi rnams rdzas su yod par smra ba 'am | yang bya ba byas zin 'das pa | da ltar ba bya ba byed bzhin pa ¦ mi byed pa ma 'ongs pa ste dus 3 dzas su yod par smra ba'o || dge tshul gyi zhes pa spong byed kyi gnyen po 4 dang ldan pa'i dge b <lb edRef="inst:4699" n="3b3"/> ste | de la dbye ba dang ¦ ngo bo  dang ¦ sgra 'jug pa'o || </seg><gap reason="omitted"/>
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
          
            
        
            
       
            
        
            
        
            
         
            
        
